  "question": "Let $y=\\log_a x$ and $a>1$. Then only one of the following statements is false. Which one is it?",
  "options": {
    "A": "If $x=1$, then $y=0$",
    "B": "If $x<1$, then $y<0$",
    "C": "If $x=\\frac12$, then $y=\\frac12$",
    "D": "If $x=a$, then $y=1"
  },
  "answer": "C",
